From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun Gupta <varun.gupta@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0530
Subject: drm/pagemap: guard drm_pagemap_put with BPM compatibility macro

When BPM_DRM_PAGEMAP_PUT_NOT_PRESENT is defined (kernel lacks
drm_pagemap_put), drm_pagemap.h provides a static inline fallback.
The unconditional definition of drm_pagemap_put() in drm_pagemap.c
then conflicts with that inline, causing a redefinition or unresolved
symbol mismatch depending on target API surface.

Guard the .c definition with BPM_DRM_PAGEMAP_PUT_NOT_PRESENT and
keep a safe header-side no-op fallback so that:
- On kernels without drm_pagemap_put: the header fallback is used.
- On kernels with drm_pagemap_put: the full implementation is compiled
  and exported.

Reference:
   a599b98607de
   drm/pagemap, drm/xe: Add refcounting to struct drm_pagemap

Signed-off-by: Varun Gupta <varun.gupta@intel.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_pagemap.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_pagemap.c
index 0f7e68a..86f97c4 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_pagemap.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_pagemap.c
@@ -930,6 +930,7 @@ EXPORT_SYMBOL(drm_pagemap_init);
  * Puts a struct drm_pagemap reference and frees the drm_pagemap object
  * if the refount reaches zero.
  */
+#ifndef BPM_DRM_PAGEMAP_PUT_NOT_PRESENT
 void drm_pagemap_put(struct drm_pagemap *dpagemap)
 {
 	if (likely(dpagemap)) {
@@ -938,6 +939,7 @@ void drm_pagemap_put(struct drm_pagemap *dpagemap)
 	}
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL(drm_pagemap_put);
+#endif

 /**
  * drm_pagemap_evict_to_ram() - Evict GPU SVM range to RAM
diff --git a/include/drm/drm_pagemap.h b/include/drm/drm_pagemap.h
index c848f57..382d4f5 100644
--- a/include/drm/drm_pagemap.h
+++ b/include/drm/drm_pagemap.h
@@ -256,7 +256,13 @@ struct drm_pagemap *drm_pagemap_create(struct drm_device *drm,

 struct drm_pagemap *drm_pagemap_page_to_dpagemap(struct page *page);

+#ifdef BPM_DRM_PAGEMAP_PUT_NOT_PRESENT
+static inline void drm_pagemap_put(struct drm_pagemap *dpagemap)
+{
+}
+#else
 void drm_pagemap_put(struct drm_pagemap *dpagemap);
+#endif

 #else


